      "bullets": [
        "OpenSSH clients use local .pub files to pre-flight public key algorithms; missing them causes GitHub authentication to fail.",
        "Without matching .pub files, OpenSSH cannot advertise key types or signatures to remote hosts during initial protocol negotiation.",
        "Regenerate missing public key files using ssh-keygen -y -f private_key to instantly resolve unexpected GitHub SSH connection rejections."
      ]
